  "identityMutations": [
    {
      "included": true,
      "notes": "The Device object is the only object whose identity can change, and only by start-up configuration: restart the example with --deviceID <n> or --deviceName <text>. The device executes WriteProperty only for Notification Class 1's Recipient_List; a write to the Device's Object_Name or Object_Identifier is refused (write-access-denied), so nothing about its identity changes over the network.",
